{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/3bbeed8096189862b1ae62a8edfa8a64.poster.avif?t=1760747804\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/3bbeed8096189862b1ae62a8edfa8a64.webm?t=1760747804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple logic building blocks to change signals and junctions. Create functioning train networks in order to deliver goods between stations in a timely matter. Transport enough cargo without any crashes to complete each level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing each level is only the beginning! Improve your solutions in a never-ending quest for efficiency! A more efficient solution comes with more satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/8448d88489f3bcfcd2b9c3f717ad9b4a.poster.avif?t=1760747804\" width=1170 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/8448d88489f3bcfcd2b9c3f717ad9b4a.webm?t=1760747804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your spot on each level's leaderboard in one (or all) of the 3 unique scoring categories. Whether you're trying to one up your friends list, or climbing the global leaderboards, every improvement is more satisfying than the last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own optional challenge restriction that adds a unique twist and offers new and refreshing puzzles to solve! Throw away your first solution and turns things on its head as you must change your approach!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090560?t=1760747804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090560?t=1760747804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/8cad7f0be610d539ffc10aada59829470eae9c07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760747804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/8cad7f0be610d539ffc10aada59829470eae9c07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760747804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/3bbeed8096189862b1ae62a8edfa8a64.poster.avif?t=1760747804\" width=1170 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/3bbeed8096189862b1ae62a8edfa8a64.webm?t=1760747804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple logic building blocks to change signals and junctions. Create functioning train networks in order to deliver goods between stations in a timely matter. Transport enough cargo without any crashes to complete each level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing each level is only the beginning! Improve your solutions in a never-ending quest for efficiency! A more efficient solution comes with more satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/8448d88489f3bcfcd2b9c3f717ad9b4a.poster.avif?t=1760747804\" width=1170 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/extras/8448d88489f3bcfcd2b9c3f717ad9b4a.webm?t=1760747804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your spot on each level's leaderboard in one (or all) of the 3 unique scoring categories. Whether you're trying to one up your friends list, or climbing the global leaderboards, every improvement is more satisfying than the last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own optional challenge restriction that adds a unique twist and offers new and refreshing puzzles to solve! Throw away your first solution and turns things on its head as you must change your approach!</p>","developers":["Logic Breaker Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3224680","name":"Train Reaction"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090560/951249d57c78be9b034a84657e39ad0b2a524271/header.jpg?t=1760747804","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090560/2070425122/905a8d323c81f95d6ee0b2d50de8bcc619f33cf1/1760324424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760330288","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090560/2070425122/905a8d323c81f95d6ee0b2d50de8